  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Waveshare ESP32-S3-Zero, 18 x 23.5 mm, 2 x 9 pins at 2.54 mm. Stacks on pin headers, or the castellations solder directly to these pads. Pin order and dimensions from the Waveshare drawing: 18.00 x 23.50 mm, rows 15.24 mm apart (pin centres 1.38 mm in from each long edge), first pin 1.59 mm from the USB end, 2.54 mm pitch. Right edge from USB end: TX, RX, IO13..IO7. Antenna (C3 chip) at the far end. Courtyard covers only the header rows: parts may sit under the module up to the header stack height against the Waveshare 2D drawing before ordering. Bottom pads not used.")
